ations. It is exported to Australia, Japan, Korea, Europe, Thailand, and the United States. BTM Resources Berhad was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"BTM Resources Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚从事木材产品的制造与销售，成立于1994年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也。","lines":["木材采伐：从事原木采伐作业。","锯木加工：经营锯木厂，将原木加工为锯材。","木材贸易：交易锯材、胶合板和原木。","木材成型：进行木材成型加工。","窑干处理：对木材进行窑干干燥处理。"],"lines_en":["Logging: Engages in logging operations.","Sawmilling: Operates sawmilling to process logs into sawn timber.","Timber trading: Trades sawn timbers, plywood, and logs.","Timber molding: Carries out timber molding operations.","Kiln-drying: Provides kiln-drying operations for timber."]}}